<title>USA: Macomb Cty, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>Macomb Cty, Mich., won by McDonald &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co. Securities, Inc. said it won $1.050 million of Macomb Cty, Mich., Macomb Cty water supply system 14 limited tax bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.12 percent.</p>
